  "title": "NiSource Generation Company: A new name that reflects a proven customer-first strategy",
  "summary": "<p>As northern Indiana continues to attract significant economic investment and energy demand growth, one thing remains unchanged: our commitment to protecting customers while supporting the region's future. &nbsp;</p><div><p>That's why NIPSCO Generation LLC is now NiSource Generation Company LLC (GenCo). &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:initial;font-size:inherit;text-align:inherit;text-transform:inherit;word-spacing:normal;caret-color:auto;white-space:inherit;\">The new name better reflects the company's role within the broader NiSource enterprise while clearly distinguishing it from NIPSCO's traditional utility operations. Importantly, this is a name change only, not a change in strategy. &nbsp;</span></p></div><p></p>",
